   :header-rows: 1
   :widths: 10 15 20 20 15 20

   * - Index
     - Numba batch
     - Numba sample updates
     - Numba remove/merge
     - JAX batch
     - JAX streaming
   * - ``CH``
     - Yes
     - Unchanged
     - Unchanged
     - Yes
     - Capacity
   * - ``CONN``
     - Unavailable
     - Unavailable
     - Unavailable
     - Unavailable
     - Unavailable
   * - ``cSIL``
     - Yes
     - Unchanged
     - Dissimilarities
     - Unavailable
     - Unavailable
   * - ``DB``
     - Yes
     - Distances
     - Distances
     - Unavailable
     - Unavailable
   * - ``GD43``
     - Yes
     - Distances
     - Distances
     - Unavailable
     - Unavailable
   * - ``GD53``
     - Yes
     - Unchanged
     - Unchanged
     - Unavailable
     - Unavailable
   * - ``PS``
     - Yes
     - Distances
     - Distances
     - Unavailable
     - Unavailable
   * - ``rCIP``
     - Unavailable
     - Unavailable
     - Unavailable
     - Unavailable
     - Unavailable
   * - ``WB``
